    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BURN BRIGHTER!! INITIATE DRY CONTACT!! 30 bosses await in the insurmountable  run-and-gun</i>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.poster.avif?t=1755112468\" width=590 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.webm?t=1755112468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.mp4?t=1755112468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>----- STORY -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Earth reaches the precipice of apocalypse, a lone boy with vengeful eyes rushes towards <u><strong>KaiserCorps</strong></u>, the leading authority on weapons technologies and the epicenter of an alien rampage. Discover the backstory of <u><strong>Geverel</strong></u>, the hollow soldier, through non-linear storytelling with comic-style art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>----- GAMEPLAY -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst through 8 stages, each loaded with 1-on-1 duels against KaiserCorps' insane experiments and top infantry. Go blazing with 4 different types of guns, then slam a centrifuge of raw energy into your enemies with the <u><strong>Tatsujin Punch</strong></u> and <u>Ignition Dash Explosion.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(<strong>Disaster Arms</strong> is intended to be played in one sitting with limited continues like an arcade game - however, an unlimited continue mode is provided for casual and newcoming players.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>----- FEATURES -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>30 bosses</strong></u> - from giant machine-monster hybrids, to your vengeful soldier brethren</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Shmup/Bullet Hell</strong></u> design philosophy meets action platformer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish artstyle and <u><strong>multi-sprite animation</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Strafe-based shooting</strong></u> controls let you evade while keeping your aim on the target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike enemy weakpoints for <u><strong>maximum damage</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct pre-apocalypse setting: Prevent the incoming dystopia!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Original soundtrack composed using YM2151+SN76489</strong></u>, the signature sound hardware of the 16-bit MD/GEN consoles</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BURN BRIGHTER!! INITIATE DRY CONTACT!! 30 bosses await in the insurmountable  run-and-gun</i>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.poster.avif?t=1755112468\" width=590 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.webm?t=1755112468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.mp4?t=1755112468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>----- STORY -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Earth reaches the precipice of apocalypse, a lone boy with vengeful eyes rushes towards <u><strong>KaiserCorps</strong></u>, the leading authority on weapons technologies and the epicenter of an alien rampage. Discover the backstory of <u><strong>Geverel</strong></u>, the hollow soldier, through non-linear storytelling with comic-style art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>----- GAMEPLAY -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst through 8 stages, each loaded with 1-on-1 duels against KaiserCorps' insane experiments and top infantry. Go blazing with 4 different types of guns, then slam a centrifuge of raw energy into your enemies with the <u><strong>Tatsujin Punch</strong></u> and <u>Ignition Dash Explosion.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(<strong>Disaster Arms</strong> is intended to be played in one sitting with limited continues like an arcade game - however, an unlimited continue mode is provided for casual and newcoming players.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>----- FEATURES -----</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>30 bosses</strong></u> - from giant machine-monster hybrids, to your vengeful soldier brethren</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Shmup/Bullet Hell</strong></u> design philosophy meets action platformer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish artstyle and <u><strong>multi-sprite animation</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Strafe-based shooting</strong></u> controls let you evade while keeping your aim on the target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike enemy weakpoints for <u><strong>maximum damage</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct pre-apocalypse setting: Prevent the incoming dystopia!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Original soundtrack composed using YM2151+SN76489</strong></u>, the signature sound hardware of the 16-bit MD/GEN consoles</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Disaster Arms is a 2D run-and-gun boss rush loaded with giant enemies inspired by 90's action games. Shoot and punch your way to the center of a geopolitical crisis.",
